"""Order auditor walker demonstrating both early-return flavors.

`skip` skips a single order and continues the audit to later orders;
`disengage` halts the whole walk the moment a fraud-flagged order
appears. Both behaviors are exercised on the same chain so the
difference is observable in the printed trace.
"""

node Order {
