"""Orchard irrigation tour: a single shared routine services both pumps and sprinklers.

A maintenance crew walker traverses a grove of irrigation devices. One union
ability handles every device kind uniformly: it logs the kind, records how many
hours the device sat idle, resets the idle counter, and tallies the service.
