    print(
        f"final state: dev={dev_state}, roadmap={roadmap_state},"
        f" aiwork={aiwork_state}"
    );
}

"""Tiny dungeon crawler: chain of rooms with a hidden treasure.

A Hunter walker traverses the rooms one by one, counting how many it
has inspected. The moment it steps into the vault (the treasure room)
it reports the find and ``disengage``s — every room past the vault is
left unseen, by design.
