"""Online store checkout: product archetypes and a checkout walker.

The cart holds a heterogeneous mix of products (paper books, digital books,
electronics, clothing). Each product type carries its own shipping and
handling rule. A single ``Checkout`` walker traverses the cart and reacts to
each product's concrete type using union triggers on a base ``Product`` node.
The walker accumulates a typed receipt report and prints an itemized bill.
