3. accepts only exact canonical JSON files under the fixed `config/operator/v03-vertical-policy/` namespace, never arbitrary repository or normal Store paths;
4. requires exact expected remote ref SHA and performs fast-forward CAS only — no force push, no ref rewind;
5. writes one exact bundle commit parented by the expected protected-state SHA while preserving every unrelated tree path;
